ates that their collaboration started in August 2022. All necessary information to answer the question is present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Calvin secured an agreement to continue a collaboration with Frank Ocean on 2023-08-22","Frank Ocean expressed a desire to collaborate with Calvin on 2022-08-01","Calvin and Frank Ocean clicked right away after meeting on 2022-08-01","Calvin met Frank Ocean at a festival on 2022-08-01"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_54","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What does help Calvin stay connected to the creative process?","golden_answer":"Calvin stays connected to the creative process by always staying up-to-date on world events and watching documentaries about artists.","hypothesis":"Calvin finds that documentaries about artists and their creative process, staying connected to current events, and music help him stay connected to the creative process. Specifically, he watches documentaries for inspiration, values staying updated on world events to connect better with his fans, and considers music a source of strength that fosters creativity.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Calvin asks Dave if the notebook helps Dave stay connected to the creative process. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin inquires about the notebook's utility for Dave in staying connected to the creative process. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Dave's blog helps others get creative, which Calvin recognizes. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin finds that the previous items discussed help him stay focused when making music. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Documentaries about artists and their creative process are a source of inspiration for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin usually watches documentaries about artists and their creative process. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin considers staying connected and up-to-date on current events to be important. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Calvin seeing something every day keeps Calvin motivated and reminds Calvin to keep pushing. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Music can help Calvin stay on track (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - The music is a source of strength for Calvin to keep going. (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Music brings people together and fosters creativity for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-11-17T10:54:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by surrounding himself with passion. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Calvin pours his heart into music within his creative haven. (event_time: 2023-05-16T11:50:00Z)\n  - Calvin's support keeps the music going. (event_time: 2023-11-13T21:15:00Z)\n  - Staying connected to world events allows Calvin to connect better with his fans. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Calvin is currently stuck with his music due to a creative block (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Supportive people motivate Calvin to get better as an artist (event_time: 2023-11-13T21:15:00Z)\n  - Calvin's friends help keep him on track. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Calvin finds creating something that brings joy is what he is all about (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin considers his creative haven a place where he focuses on music. (event_time: 2023-05-16T11:50:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITI